Article history:                                                   This study was done to investigate the physicochemical properties of bee honey samples collected from
Received 23 February 2019                                          different locations in west of Libya. The concentration of essential elements (Na, K, and Ca), and toxic
Accepted 21 March 2019                                             heavy metals (Pb, Cd, Hg, and As) in honey samples were determined by flame photometer, and atomic
