   Electrical conductivity (EC) is a best criterion of botanical origin of bee
honey and today it is determined in routine honey purity and quality
control [21]. The EC mean values of BL, MS, RH, AB, TC, and TE honey
solutions at 25 oC, were found 801, 638.5, 679.3, 767.3, 696.4, and 707.1
