Pharmacopoeia (≤ 800 μS/cm) [22]. While, the higher value of EC 1006,
and 841 μS/cm were observed in the GR, and AD honey solutions at 25 °C.,
respectively. Results agree with Gangwar et al. [23] who noted that EC of
Ethiopian honey ranged from 170 to 1350 μS/cm. Inorganic and ionic
